SUMMARY:Colson Whitehead LIVE in Montclair!
DESCRIPTION:Two-time Pulitzer Prize winner Colson Whitehead comes to Montclair for a live conversation about his highly anticipated new novel Cool Machine\, exploring the ideas\, characters\, and inspirations behind his latest work. Join one of America’s most acclaimed contemporary writers for an evening of storytelling\, insight\, and audience discussion at Memorial Auditorium on July 22. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
