SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! Garret Mountain
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJoin me for the 5K paved loop at Garret Mountain
  Reservation.\nWe will meet at the parking lot on the loop by Park Road. G
 PS Address for Garrett is 8 Mountain Ave Woodland Park.\n\nGarret Mountain
  Reservation\, located in both Woodland Park and Paterson\, is one of Pass
 aic County’s most frequented parks. The original landscape was designed 
 by the famed Olmsted Brothers Firm. The 310 acres of recreational space si
 ts more than 500 feet above sea level\, with scenic views of Paterson and 
 the New York City skyline. Lambert Castle and Lambert Tower\, two of Passa
 ic County’s historic sites\, are also located within Garret Mountain Res
 ervation.\n\nRain or extreme weather will cancel the event.\n\nCollaborati
 ve walk with "Montclair Women Over 50."\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for 
 a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own preparedn
 ess and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or m
 ishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/315759290/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260720T121313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T121313Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
