SUMMARY:Dive-In Movie
DESCRIPTION:Family Fun at the Pool!\nEnjoy an afternoon of swimming and family fun while watching a movie from the pool. Bring your floats and enjoy a unique movie experience from the water with family and friends. \nFREE for Members \nNonmembers:\nAges 13 and up: $5 • Under 13: $3\nRegistration required \n  \nThe Super Mario Bros. Movie\nSunday\, July 19 \nThe Goonies\nSunday\, July 26 \nJaws\nSunday\, August 16 \nHighlights: \n\nBig screen poolside movie viewing\nFun pool floats and noodles\nFamily-friendly environment\nStay for Family Splash Time after the movie!\n\nREGISTER HERE\n  \nQuestions? Contact the Aquatics Department at aquaticsdept@jccmetrowest.org
