CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nInstructor-led strength and conditioning class desig
 ned to hit every major muscle group in just 30 minutes. Using a combinati
 on of compound lifts\, bodyweight movements\, and targeted conditioning w
 ork\, each session is programmed to build real strength and leave you ene
 rgized for the rest of the day. Instructors scale every movement so you w
