SUMMARY:250 Years of American Music
DESCRIPTION:The Navesink Brass\, a five piece brass quintet\, returns to 
 the Nutley Public Library for an outdoor concert to celebrate America’s 
 250th Anniversary with a setlist of patriotic songs. Seating will be 
 limited\, please bring a lawn chair to ensure seating.\n\nIf it rains\, the 
 concert will be held on the Second Floor of the Library. This is part of 
 our program series\, celebrating America’s 250th Anniversary.
