SUMMARY:Heavenly Finds Thrift Shop is Open Saturday!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T130000
DTSTAMP:20260722T033327Z
UID:20jtjgpj0msfp01losa0of1h48@google.com__20260905
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20240208T204933Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span>
 </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>Our Thr
 ift Shop\, located in Livingston\, is open </span><b><b>nearly every Tues
 day from 10am to 2pm</b></b><span> and<span> </span><b><b>an occasional 
 Saturday -- this month the Thrift Shop is open the first Saturday of the m
 onth</b></b> <b><b>from 10am to 1pm</b></b>. For more information visit 
 <span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><s
 pan><span><b><b><b><a href="https://www.heavenlyfinds.org/" target="_blank
 ">https://www.heavenlyfinds.org/</a></b></b></b><span>. </span></span></s
 pan></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
 </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><s
 pan><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><p><span> </span>This partne
 rship<span> began in the Fall of 2021 and we are </span><b><b>thankful</
 b></b><span> that because of this ministry\, we are able to support many 
 organizations and worthy causes.</span></p></span></span></span></span></s
 pan></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><s
 pan><p><span>Donations are accepted</span><span> in Livingston any time ex
