 the game to attend and join a table.\n\nMany players will be beginners. 
 There is no instructor.\n\nThere will a limited number of NMJL cards from 
 previous years and Mah Jongg sets available.\n\nPlease bring sets and cards 
 if you own them.\n\nAdditional dates:\n\nAugust 10 & 24\n\nSeptember 14 & 
 28\n
