DTEND:20260917T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20260917T000000Z
SUMMARY:Morning Book Club
DESCRIPTION:September 17 The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes by Arthur Conan 
 Doyle\n\nThe Adventures of Sherlock Holmes" by Arthur Conan Doyle is a 
 collection of short stories first published in 1892. These twelve tales 
 feature the legendary consulting detective Sherlock Holmes and his 
 companion Dr. Watson\, narrated from Watson's perspective. Each mystery 
 explores social injustices while showcasing Holmes's brilliant deductive 
 methods and unconventional approach to justice. The stories introduce 
 memorable characters and cases that have captivated readers for over a 
 century\, establishing Holmes as one of literature's most enduring 
 detectives.
LOCATION:West Caldwell - New Book Area
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Book Club
UID:LibCal-10340-17032139
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17032139
END:VEVENT
