CREATED:20260505T163944Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260707T181435Z
UID:3403-1790447400-1790456400@neearth.org
SUMMARY:Fall Harvest Fiesta
DESCRIPTION:Join NEEC for a festive evening celebrating another year\nof community\, sustainability\, and bountiful harvests.\n  \nDine on a delicious Mexican buffet\, catered by Mezoco. Enjoy live music. Bid on wonderful silent auction items. \nAll proceeds go toward NEEC projects — our six community gardens\, 18 Free Little Pantries\, and three pollinator gardens. With your help\, we can continue to feed the food insecure and advocate for a more sustainable community. \nFor tickets\, visit NEECfiesta2026.eventbrite.com. \nTHANK YOU to our sponsors: Partners for Health\, Mulvey Custom Contracting\, and the Board of the Bloomfield Cemetery. \nWe are excited to invite community organizations\, businesses\, and individuals to become sponsors. For more information about sponsorship opportunities\, email Amanda at amccabe@neearth.org.
URL:https://neearth.org/events/fall-harvest-fiesta/
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Congregational Church\, 195 Ridgewood Ave\, Glen Ridge\, NJ\, 07028\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Outreach
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://neearth.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/fiesta-invitation4.png
END:VEVENT
